# Minimal overlay — AAA role only.
# Containerlab default already configures:
#   system ssh-server mgmt-netconf (port 830, mgmt, disable-shell true)
#   system netconf-server mgmt -> ssh-server mgmt-netconf
# (see containerlab nodes/srl/version_configs/netconf.cfg)
# What defaults do NOT cover: NETCONF RPC authorization.
# Per Nokia docs all <allowed-operations> are disabled by default and must be
# enabled one-by-one under /system aaa authorization role <name> netconf.
# Least-privilege set for v1 (no copy-config/delete-config/kill-session/url).
set / system aaa authorization role yang2sdk-test services [ netconf ]
set / system aaa authorization role yang2sdk-test netconf allowed-operations [ get get-config get-data get-schema edit-config edit-data commit discard-changes lock unlock validate close-session ]
